WEBVTT

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:42.160
And thus, I humbly ask that you return
to Ryuubi-dono the blade I gave you.

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:43.910
To: Enjutsu-dono.

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:47.110
From: The beautiful, elegant Enshuu.

00:01:47.110 --> 00:01:51.220
Ryuubi-dono, so you'd like me
to return your sword, yes?

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:51.960
Yes.

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:53.130
Please!

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:54.000
No!

00:01:55.440 --> 00:02:01.030
I traded it for a robe that idiots can't see.

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:03.430
Now, I don't have to give it back.

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:07.870
I know. But it's been handed down through
my family for generations-

00:02:07.870 --> 00:02:10.650
I don't care!

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:12.240
Please!

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:13.910
Return my blade.

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:16.810
I'll do anything to get it back.

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:18.880
I said, no!

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:20.470
Miu-sama, a word...

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:22.370
What is it, Choukun?

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.140
Ryuubi, was it?

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:30.520
Yes.

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:35.480
You said that you'd do <i>anything
</i>to get that sword back, right?

00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:38.680
I-I-I guess...

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:40.560
You guess?

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:43.030
Yes! I'll do anything!

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:44.720
Very well!

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:49.450
Then exterminate the monster
that hides within my territory!

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:51.820
Then I'll give you back your sword!

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:54.880
Monster?

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:55.620
Yes.

00:02:55.620 --> 00:03:00.760
You see, there is an ancient shrine
on a nearby mountain.

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:05.060
Lately, a monster has appeared
every night and caused trouble.

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:09.480
We were going to tear down the
shrine to make me a villa there!

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:12.180
Thanks to the monster, the construction
isn't progressing at all!

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:15.390
We've sent forces out to get rid of it,

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:20.250
but everyone runs away once
they see the monster.

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:21.320
Ryuubi!

00:03:21.320 --> 00:03:26.900
If you want your blade back, then defeat
this troublesome, evil monster!

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:28.030
All right?

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:30.520
<i>All right?</i>

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:32.230
All right!

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:39.970
<b>Episode 8
Enjutsu Orders a
Monster's Extermination</b>

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:43.900
I'm honored that she's allowed
us to stay here

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:46.650
in her palace until we defeat
the monster, but...

00:03:46.650 --> 00:03:50.490
These rooms are so ugly, it's distracting.

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:54.320
I didn't think it would be easy,

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:56.720
but I didn't think we'd end up
chasing monsters, either.

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:01.520
I can't fight a monster!

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:03.860
Don't worry!

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:06.190
Rin Rin and the gang are with you!

00:04:06.190 --> 00:04:11.260
You guys seem pretty confident. I thought
you were scared of monsters.

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:14.590
Really?

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:18.570
Well, I dunno about real monsters...

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:21.600
But everyone knows that most of the time,
it's the guy you met from the junkyard,

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:23.790
at the beginning of the episode,
behind everything.

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:25.050
That's right!

00:04:25.050 --> 00:04:27.930
I'll kick his ass!

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:29.640
Kan'u-san! Chouhi-san!

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:30.830
I'm counting on you!

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:32.430
Leave it to us!

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:35.680
You'll be perfectly safe,
like riding on a big boat!

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:43.700
It certainly feels like there
might be monsters about.

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.930
Stop it...

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:47.740
Over there?

00:04:56.160 --> 00:05:00.270
If they built a villa up here, it would
have a pretty nice view.

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:10.230
Jeez, we're finally at the top.

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:26.230
And this sure looks like the
place a monster might live.

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:30.930
Shouldn't Ryuubi-san have stayed at the inn?

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:32.920
No!

00:05:32.920 --> 00:05:35.990
We're here to retrieve my sword,

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:39.480
so I can't be the only one to stay
at the inn, where it's safe!

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:45.820
Leave!

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:46.620
Where are you?

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:47.570
Come out!

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:50.170
Leave!

00:05:50.170 --> 00:05:52.410
Show yourself!

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:03.720
Rin Rin, stay on your guard!

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:05.010
Right!

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:16.840
A monster!

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:18.530
A monster!

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:26.210
Don't put your knee there!

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:28.680
And don't rub me so much.

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:31.430
No, not there...

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:37.030
Hey, don't faint!

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:44.230
Damn! Our light...

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:45.800
Shuri! Ryuubi-dono!

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.090
We're falling back!

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:48.150
Right!

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:49.280
Understood.

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:52.180
Ryuubi-san, grab Aisha-san's
Seiryuu Engetsutou!

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:53.650
R-R-Right!

00:06:53.650 --> 00:06:55.830
Sorry, get my spear, too.

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:11.820
So much for leaving it to you two!

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:14.190
That was absolutely pathetic.

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:15.580
I'm sorry.

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:16.690
Yeah...

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:20.570
You're just lucky Shuri had the presence
of mind to grab them before we left.

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:26.250
What kind of warrior throws their
own weapon down in terror?

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:30.320
Anyway, Ryuubi-dono, you
were surprisingly calm.

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:34.860
I apologize, but I thought you would be the
first to panic at the sight of a monster.

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:40.710
Well, I guess I was just so surprised,
I forgot to panic.

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:46.010
But this isn't really a laughing matter.

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:47.950
What?

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:50.670
The monster was that terrifying?

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:51.670
Yes.

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:55.970
It had the face of a monkey, the body
of a tanuki, the legs of a tiger,

00:07:55.970 --> 00:07:59.550
a snake's tail, and it screamed with a strange
voice, like a white thrush's call.

00:07:59.550 --> 00:08:02.500
It was a terrifying monster!

00:08:06.990 --> 00:08:10.330
We fought valiantly against
this terrifying opponent,

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:18.390
striking against it with our blades,
using everything we had!

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:22.490
But when we had almost slain it...

00:08:22.490 --> 00:08:24.620
It escaped?

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:25.810
Yes.

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:30.420
What a shame. You were so close.

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:34.100
Then I suppose it's impossible for
you to defeat this monster...

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:36.820
No, it's not!

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.780
You have some plan?

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:39.680
Yes!

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:43.410
With the power of the holy
blade that smites evil,

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:48.500
we should be able to render the final blow
to that monster and its evil magics!

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:49.670
Blade...

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:57.430
Enjutsu-sama, would you return that blade to
us, so that we may defeat your monster?

00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:01.120
Well... I guess I could.

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:03.000
N-No, Miu-sama!

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:06.460
What if you give it back,
and they just leave!

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:09.680
That's right!

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:10.520
Very well.

00:09:10.870 --> 00:09:14.730
Then why don't we leave
this here, in its place?

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:16.450
What is it?

00:09:17.790 --> 00:09:20.410
It seems like a normal mug-

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:27.170
What? This is the famous mug of mystery, the likes
of which you'll find no other in all the land!

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:29.800
The mug of mystery?

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:34.630
Behold! Not only is the
top of the lid sealed,

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:39.150
a wonder in and of itself, but the
bottom of the mug is open!

00:09:39.150 --> 00:09:41.810
Everyone who sees it will crane
their necks in wonder!

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:45.350
Indeed, that is very mysterious...

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:50.540
Enjutsu-sama, I'll leave this in your care.
So could you loan us the sword for now?

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:52.230
Yes. Very well!

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:57.140
I can't get the lid off...

00:09:57.140 --> 00:10:00.890
What a truly mysterious object!

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:06.350
Um, are you sure about relinquishing
the blade for something like that?

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:08.080
Why not?

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:10.370
I'm pleased to have acquired such
a famous vessel of pottery.

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:14.830
Even if they run away with the blade,
I still have the better deal.

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:20.460
Well, if you're fine with that, then so am I.

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:29.070
I'm amazed you managed to pull
that off with a straight face.

00:10:29.070 --> 00:10:30.520
That's right!

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:34.690
But I'm surprised.

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:39.280
I had no idea that this sword had
a holy power to defeat evil.

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:42.130
It doesn't.

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:44.370
Then...

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:51.510
Enjutsu-san doesn't really seem trustworthy,
so I figured I'd get the sword back first.

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:55.780
But since we agreed to it, we need
to get rid of that monster.

00:10:55.780 --> 00:11:03.500
I don't want everyone saying we stole the sword
from her, in exchange for an ordinary mug.

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:08.030
But if the sword doesn't have any magic power,
then how are we going to defeat the monster?

00:11:08.030 --> 00:11:13.030
It was huge and glowing, and it cried in
that creepy voice, and it breathed fire!

00:11:13.030 --> 00:11:15.650
It glowed because it was painted
with glowing moss.

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:20.850
I think the cry was the sound of
a seashell resounding in a jug,

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:23.390
and it didn't breathe fire.

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:26.080
Then that monster...

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:27.330
Was a fake!

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:32.520
You two never learn.

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:34.630
A fake...

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:38.020
So, I think we can easily take it out,

00:11:38.020 --> 00:11:44.510
but I wonder why someone
would do such a thing...

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:59.210
Leave...

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:04.050
Look upon me and fear, for I am Ryuubi Gentoku,
the descendant of Chuuzan Ryuushou!

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:06.780
Last night, I was caught off-guard.

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:12.090
But today, with this blade worth 1000 gold pieces, with which
a man could live in ease for three years, I shall defeat you!

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:18.210
We've already received an advance on defeating
the monster, so we can't retreat!

00:12:25.850 --> 00:12:28.250
A monster!

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:30.000
A monster!

00:12:39.850 --> 00:12:41.520
Leave...

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:49.490
What's with these guys?

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:52.080
Man, they had me going for a moment.

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:54.430
They all fainted tonight.

00:12:54.430 --> 00:12:56.090
Hilarious.

00:12:56.090 --> 00:13:01.280
And they brought us some expensive
looking swords and money, too!

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:02.850
Can we take that?

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:04.670
They got it from the government.

00:13:04.670 --> 00:13:06.060
Don't worry.

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:13.760
I don't think you should be touching
people's things without permission.

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:17.670
Got you!

00:13:17.670 --> 00:13:18.610
Don't move.

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:20.770
I don't want to hurt a kid.

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:21.640
H-Heavy...

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:22.890
What?

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:25.420
I figured if we flashed some
money and valuables,

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:29.460
they'd come out to get them, and they did.

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:32.380
I was worried they'd figure it out.

00:13:32.380 --> 00:13:33.370
Damn it!

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:34.530
You tricked us!

00:13:34.530 --> 00:13:36.250
That's my line.

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:39.460
Why did you do this?

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:42.410
It's a bit much for a trick.

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:44.010
It's not a trick!

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:45.400
Then why?

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:46.630
Please stop.

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:53.740
I'll explain.

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:57.380
We're all orphans.

00:13:57.380 --> 00:14:01.980
Everyone here lost their parents to
things such as bandits or disease.

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:06.840
They lost their homes, and began to find
their way here, alone or in pairs,

00:14:06.840 --> 00:14:15.870
and we started to bring the children here we found
under bridges or crying next to dead parents.

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:18.610
And soon, we were this many.

00:14:18.610 --> 00:14:26.160
We fend off starvation by eating wild
grasses or helping the nearby farms.

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:30.640
To us, this shrine is a wonderful
home that keeps the rain off,

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:35.020
but the lord of this land is going to tear
it down and build herself a villa.

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:40.330
I see. That's why you decided to pretend to be a
monster, to scare off everyone who came here.

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:46.490
Yes. We thought if we scared off everyone, they'd
eventually give up the idea of tearing it down.

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:47.990
Unforgivable!

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:51.780
I'm going back to Enjutsu's palace and
punching her in the face right now!

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:53.220
Hold on, Rin Rin.

00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:56.610
I know how you feel, but that
won't solve the problem.

00:14:56.610 --> 00:14:58.250
Then, what should we do?

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:00.600
Shuri, do you have any ideas?

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:02.750
Let me see...

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:10.840
I don't know if it will work, but Enjutsu totally believed
in the monster, so I think there's a possibility.

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:12.240
Then...

00:15:12.240 --> 00:15:14.980
Shuri's got small tits, but she's brilliant!

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:17.460
So relax, as if you were
riding a giant octopus!

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:20.210
You mean, as if you were
riding a giant tuna.

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:22.510
A giant ship.

00:15:30.470 --> 00:15:33.270
Descending the mountain
this late would be tough.

00:15:33.270 --> 00:15:35.980
Please stay here tonight.

00:16:01.220 --> 00:16:02.580
Mom...

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:04.310
You're up early.

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:07.120
What?

00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:08.410
You scared me.

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:11.250
Is that your mother's grave?

00:16:11.250 --> 00:16:15.870
It's not just my mom. It's everyone's
moms and dads.

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:20.670
There's nothing buried under it,
but that's what we all decided.

00:16:21.280 --> 00:16:22.630
I see.

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:27.280
Hey, want to pick flowers for your mom?

00:16:27.280 --> 00:16:28.460
Why?

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:31.420
Flowers... That's something a girl would do.

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:33.210
What?

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:37.350
I'm sure your mom would like them, OK?

00:16:44.840 --> 00:16:46.070
Here you go.

00:16:46.070 --> 00:16:49.320
Give these flowers to your mom.

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:06.610
Then you defeated the monster?

00:17:06.610 --> 00:17:07.580
Yes!

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:09.710
Wonderful!

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:11.140
Well done.

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:16.080
But the sword expended all of its power
while defeating the monster,

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:19.990
and it turned to sparkling
dust and faded away.

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:21.860
I see...

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:25.040
That's too bad.

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:32.010
But I promised to return it in the event
that you defeated the monster.

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:35.460
Don't worry. I won't blame you for losing it.

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:37.360
Wonderful!

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:39.650
But there's one thing that bothers me...

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:41.450
What? Speak.

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:48.650
It seems the monster was formed by the angry
spirits of children who died from starvation.

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:50.980
Unless you lower your taxes,
build an orphanage,

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:55.420
and attend to the poor in your lands, there's
no telling when it will appear again!

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:01.810
Please consider this matter carefully!

00:18:02.590 --> 00:18:04.000
Here you are, Miu-sama!

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:06.570
I've been waiting for this.

00:18:10.990 --> 00:18:15.660
Honey water from such a rare
mug tastes even better!

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:22.740
But those fools... It seems they totally
forgot they left this mug with me!

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:28.520
That aside, what of the matter
that Koumei mentioned?

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:34.170
Attend to the poor or the monster
will come back? That?

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:35.220
Yes.

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:42.290
To be honest, I don't like spending
money on anyone but myself.

00:18:42.290 --> 00:18:46.000
But what if the monster comes back?

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:50.860
We'll cross that bridge when we come to it.

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:52.850
Brilliant, Miu-sama!

00:18:52.850 --> 00:18:54.990
Your hasty conclusions leave me in awe!

00:18:54.990 --> 00:18:57.100
You must be the most thoughtless
ruler in the land!

00:18:58.040 --> 00:18:59.870
I'm so flattered!

00:18:59.870 --> 00:19:01.280
More praise!

00:19:03.140 --> 00:19:10.260
Shuri, from what I've seen, that won't be enough
of a threat to make Enjutsu listen.

00:19:10.260 --> 00:19:11.810
I agree.

00:19:11.810 --> 00:19:12.850
Then...

00:19:12.850 --> 00:19:14.370
That was just the beginning.

00:19:14.370 --> 00:19:16.520
It truly begins tonight.

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:22.120
Listen. Pretend to be an evil spirit,
scare the wits out of Enjutsu-san,

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:25.360
and get her to agree to help the poor.

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:27.610
Everyone, are you ready?

00:19:27.610 --> 00:19:30.480
Leave it to us...

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:33.200
We're ghosts!

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:35.580
So am I!

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:39.330
You seem really into it.

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:44.790
Yes. I love nasty tricks like this.

00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:46.580
Figured.

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:49.750
By the way, what are you
supposed to be, Rin Rin?

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:52.240
The terrifying monster, FunyaMonya,

00:19:52.240 --> 00:19:57.950
who comes in the night and licks your bellybutton
if you pee where you aren't meant to!

00:19:58.390 --> 00:20:01.960
So a monster, yeah.

00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:05.700
Aisha-san. Ryuubi-san. I'm not
sure which of you is which,

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:06.860
but good luck!

00:20:06.860 --> 00:20:07.430
Right!

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:08.720
Right!

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:11.020
OK, everyone! Here we go!

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:25.180
I can't drink any more honey water.

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:26.510
What?

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:32.940
I'm still sleepy... So sleepy...

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:39.510
Who are you?

00:20:39.510 --> 00:20:43.340
I've never seen your face before...

00:20:57.010 --> 00:20:59.240
I'm sorry!

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:00.660
I won't waste any more money!

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:01.700
I'll lower taxes!

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:04.670
I'll make an orphanage and help the poor!

00:21:04.670 --> 00:21:06.990
I'll stop drinking too much honey tea!

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:09.260
So please forgive me!

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:12.500
I mean it!

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:13.930
I promise!

00:21:13.930 --> 00:21:18.160
Forgive me!

00:21:20.100 --> 00:21:24.420
What was that, last night?

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:28.300
I'm sure it was a real monster that
came to teach Enjutsu a lesson!

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:29.760
What?

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:32.470
There's no such things as monsters.

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:35.520
Then what had her so scared?

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:37.100
Let me see...

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:45.770
I think what I said, when I told her about the
monster stuck by her, gave her a nightmare.

00:21:45.770 --> 00:21:49.940
I think she was a bit too scared for that...

00:21:49.940 --> 00:21:54.590
Well, who cares what it was;
she's doing what we asked.

00:21:54.590 --> 00:21:55.630
That's right.

00:21:55.630 --> 00:21:57.660
From what I heard from Choukun-dono,

00:21:57.660 --> 00:22:04.760
she gave food to the poor, and she's made
plans to build an orphanage very soon.

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:08.240
If it's going to make the government there better,
then I'm glad she had that nightmare!

00:22:08.240 --> 00:22:09.920
That's right.

00:22:09.920 --> 00:22:11.510
Right!

00:22:24.490 --> 00:22:25.960
What's wrong, Ryuubi-dono?

00:22:25.960 --> 00:22:28.000
No... Nothing!

00:22:35.410 --> 00:22:38.710
Anyway, we got back your sword.

00:22:38.710 --> 00:22:40.380
All's well that ends well.

00:22:40.380 --> 00:22:42.440
It's all thanks to you.

00:22:42.440 --> 00:22:44.220
Thank you so much!

00:22:44.220 --> 00:22:46.840
Now we just need to head
back to Touka Village!

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:48.810
We can take it easy now!

00:22:48.810 --> 00:22:52.790
I think we've been doing
that this whole time.

00:24:25.970 --> 00:24:31.210
Miu-sama, what did you buy from that shady-looking
group, the two guys and a girl?

00:24:31.210 --> 00:24:37.060
An extremely rare die, whose front and back add up
to seven, no matter how many times you throw it!

00:24:37.060 --> 00:24:40.790
Miu-sama, all dice do that, I think.

00:24:40.790 --> 00:24:42.630
No! I was tricked!

00:24:42.630 --> 00:24:45.650
Find and punish them!

00:24:45.650 --> 00:24:47.920
Next time on <i>Shin Koihime
Musou,</i> Episode 9:

00:24:47.920 --> 00:24:52.040
Gakushin, Riten, and Ukin
Protect a Village.

00:24:50.050 --> 00:24:55.010
<b>Episode 9
Gakushin, Riten, and
Ukin Protect a Village</b>

00:24:52.040 --> 00:24:53.250
Roll it!

00:24:53.250 --> 00:24:54.860
Roll?

00:24:55.010 --> 00:24:59.960
